flowchart TD
    UI[Browser chat UI] -->|POST /api/chat| API[FastAPI]
    API <--> History[In-memory session history]
    API --> Assistant[TravelAssistant orchestrator]
    Assistant --> Retrieval[Semantic retrieval on every request]
    Assistant --> Router[Keyword and regex tool routing]

    subgraph RAG[Knowledge and retrieval]
        Files[Three local Markdown summaries] --> Split[700-character chunks / 120 overlap]
        Split --> Embeddings[Gemini document embeddings]
        Embeddings --> Chroma[(Chroma vector store)]
        Retrieval --> Query[Gemini query embedding]
        Query --> Chroma
        Chroma --> Context[Top five chunks and source metadata]
    end

    subgraph MCP[On-demand local MCP servers]
        Router --> Client[Python MCP client over stdio]
        Client --> Weather[Weather MCP server]
        Client --> Currency[Currency MCP server]
        Weather <--> OpenMeteo[Open-Meteo API]
        Currency <--> Frankfurter[Frankfurter API]
        Weather --> Results[Tool results or failure details]
        Currency --> Results
    end

    Context --> Prompt[LangChain prompt]
    Results --> Prompt
    History -->|Last eight messages| Prompt
    Assistant -->|Current question| Prompt
    Prompt --> Gemini[Gemini answer generation]
    Gemini --> Response[Answer with source links and MCP status]
    Response --> UI
